  "an4.195:2.3": "",
  "an4.195:2.4": "",
  "an4.195:2.5": "The Nigaṇṭhas taught that one could not be freed from the round of rebirth until having experienced all the pain resulting from one’s past actions. For the Buddha’s response to this point, see <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an3.100'>AN 3:101</a>.",
  "an4.195:2.6": "",
